---
description: Atlas project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Always read and follow `AGENTS.md` in the repo root before writing any code.

- Do only the step requested. No extra features, tools, or refactors.
- Touch only the files the prompt lists. If another file must change, stop and explain.
- Never auto-approve T2 (irreversible) actions. Never hardcode keys or model names.
- Check current library docs before using an API. Do not guess request formats.
- Add tests, run them, and finish with: what changed, how to run, how to test, what is left.
